===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tr|ota|آج|tr=ac|t=hungry}}, from {{inh|tr|trk-oat|tr=ac|t=hungry}}, from {{inh|tr|trk-pro|*āç}}, {{m|trk-pro|*ạ̄č|t=hunger}}.
{{rel-top|cognates}}
Cognate with {{cog|otk|𐰀𐰲|ts=aç|t=hungry}}, {{cog|oui|tr=aç|t=hungry}}, {{cog|xqa|tr=āç|t=hungry}}, {{cog|az|ac|t=hungry}}, {{cog|ba|ас|t=hungry}}, {{cog|cv|выҫӑ|t=hunger, hungry}}, {{cog|kk|аш|t=hunger}}, {{cog|kjh|ас|t=hunger, hungry}}, {{cog|qwm|tr=aç|t=hungry}}, {{cog|ky|ач|t=hungry}}, {{cog|alt|ач|t=hunger}}, {{cog|tk|āç|t=hungry}}, {{cog|tyv|аш||hunger, hungry}}, {{cog|ug|ئاچ|t=hungry}}, {{cog|uz|och|t=hungry}}, {{cog|sah|аас|t=hunger}}.
{{rel-bottom}}

